	"TagLine": "A collection of jelly-like or slimy foods. Includes new cooking recipes, machine goods and crops. ",
	"Description": "A content pack mod for Stardew Valley, containing a variety of edible gels and jellies. Adds several new crops and a forage item as raw materials, and gives you something edible to make out excess slime.\n\nDependencies:\nAll of these are needed for the mod to function:\n- Artisan Valley\n- Producer Framework Mod\n- Farm Type Manager\n- JsonAssets\n\nOptional Dependencies\nThese enable more recipes and items:\n- PPJA Fruits and Veggies\n- PPJA More Trees\n- Bonster's Trees\n- Bonster's Rare Crops\n- Shaved Ice and Frozen Treats\n- PPJA Fresh Meat",
